# FAQ and troubleshooting


::divider{dual}
## General

::accordion
@item Is Radii Office really free?
Yes. The apps are free to use, have no ads, and the code is open source. Anything you make is yours!
@item Do I need an account?
Not for the editing apps. You only need one for the server apps (Phosphor, Beta, Mintcode, Overshare and Yuzu mail), because they keep your data on a server!
@item Where are my documents?
In your browser's storage on this computer, or in a file if you chose **Keep a file on this computer**. Nothing is uploaded unless you share it!
@item Can I use it offline?
Yes. After the first visit the apps work without a connection. See [Offline and desktop](#/offline-desktop)!
::end

## Keydown

::accordion
@item My tag stayed as plain text.
Tags format when you press Space after them, or Enter at the end of the line. Check the symbols and the letters for a typo, then use **Re-format**, which underlines any tag that could not be formatted!
@item I want to show a tag without using it.
Put a backslash before its symbols, like `\#R\#text\#`, or put the tag in backticks!
@item Which tag makes this look?
Open the [reference](#/keydown-reference) and use the filter. Every section has live examples!
::end

## Problems

::accordion
@item A page is blank or old after an update.
Do a hard refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R, or Cmd+Shift+R on a Mac). Apps are cached for offline use, and the new version loads on the next visit!
@item My BitLang program ends instantly.
Make sure you are in View mode, do not type in the page while it runs, and check the program for a `stop()` call. The error note shows how long it ran and why it ended!
@item Real email in Yuzu shows as plain text.
Only mail that arrived after the mail server's update has a formatted version, and you may have pressed **Plain text** on that message!
@item Printing looks different from the screen.
Use **Print Preview** in Writeout or Bitbook first. Some gradients print as low-resolution pictures in Chrome, and Firefox prints them well. Try printing from Firefox if you see this!
::end

## Shortcuts

| Where | Keys | Does |
| --- | --- | --- |
| This page | `Ctrl+K`{key} or `/`{key} | Search the docs |
| Writeout | `Ctrl+Enter`{key} | New page |
| Writeout Source mode | `Tab`{key} | Indent the line |
| Waterflow, Phosphor | `Ctrl+K`{key} | Quick switcher |
| Inkpath | `G`{key} | Gradient tool |
| Peeker | `E`{key} | Edit tool |
